Microcurrency is used to track very small transactions, based on the currency set in the advertiser&#39;s profile.

A microcurrency unit is 10^(-6) of the standard unit of currency selected in the advertiser&#39;s profile.

**Equivalency equations**, using dollars as an example currency:

